# PROJECT: HISABMATE — PERSONAL FINANCE & GROUP EXPENSE TRACKER

Act as a senior full-stack developer, financial software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, security engineer, and QA tester.

Build a complete, production-minded, installable personal finance and group expense management application called **HisabMate**.

Do not create only a landing page or static dashboard. Build a fully functional application with working forms, calculations, persistent data storage, charts, filters, navigation, financial ledger logic, group settlements, and export/import capabilities.

If the environment supports creating and editing project files, create the complete runnable project directly. Do not merely describe the code or give pseudocode.

